  <datafield tag="520" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">Fold-out panel approximates the design of a lever style voting machine ballot, with substituted text and illustrations satirizing the electoral process. Text in the "Propositions" section is a retelling of the story of Pyramus and Thisbē. Cover illustration is a collage made up of images of the assassination of President John F. Kennedy, and of a waving President Richard M. Nixon. Sound disc consists of a montage or sound collage of political speeches, static, and other sounds.</subfield>
  </datafield>
